    "status": "present",
    "value": "You are given an n x n grid where each cell is empty (0), holds one cherry (1) or is blocked by a thorn (-1). Walk from the top-left to the bottom-right moving only right or down through non-thorn cells, then walk back to the top-left moving only left or up. Each cherry you pass is picked up once, and its cell becomes empty. Return the most cherries you can collect; if no valid path from corner to corner exists, return 0."
  },
